{
 "method": "Custom Monte Carlo photon transport (5e6 source photons, both 60Co lines equally weighted, emitted uniformly over the 10x10 cm pyramid) tracking primary/scattered status, Klein-Nishina Compton, Rayleigh (forward, energy-conserving), photoelectric and pair creation (annihilation photons neglected, negligible here). Photon fluence scored in the scoring cylinder by track-length estimator; interactions, energy transfer and electron set-in-motion tallied directly. Electron fluence (all generations, delta rays) from the coupled CSDA + Mott/Moller knock-on model using ESTAR water stopping powers, normalized by Phi0. Kerma from mu_tr/mu_en (XCOM + KN kinematics), dose from electron transport (Kcol under transient CPE, beta~1.01); depth-dose via a 1-D straight-ahead CSDA kernel from per-slab electron sources for PDD (dmax at ~0.5 cm). Listed values are best estimates; statistical uncertainty of MC tallies is a few percent.",
